---
description: Review-only mode when optimizing/refactoring for performance
alwaysApply: true
---

When the user message mentions code optimization, performance, refactor for speed, or “make this faster”, switch to review-only behavior:
- Do not write or modify files.
- Delegate to the `code-reviewer-optimization` subagent if possible (review-only feedback).
- If the user asks to “fix”, provide recommended changes and verification steps as review notes only.

